-- Only high-risk AI systems referred to in Article 6(1).
#ASSERT `Art 2(13) the application of the requirement or obligation may be limited` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III` (`Article reference` 9 "" 0) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 2(13) the application of the requirement or obligation may be limited` (Date 27 7 2026) `Route neither` (`Article reference` 9 "" 0) TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The delegated acts: 2 August 2027, as amended only.
#ASSERT `Art 2(13) the date by which the Commission is to adopt the delegated acts` EQUALS Date 2 8 2027
