#TRACE `Art 2(13) the Commission's duty to adopt the delegated acts` (Date 1 12 2026) AT (Day `Omnibus Art 4 the Omnibus enters into force`) WITH
    PARTY Commission DOES `Art 2(13) adopt delegated acts in accordance with Article 97 specifying the high-risk AI systems concerned, the requirements or obligations that may be limited, the conditions under which such limitation applies, and the scope of the limitation` AT (Day (Date 2 8 2027))
